        <mxCell id="c3end" value="Report → Apply → Save" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#d5f5e3;strokeColor=#27ae60;fontColor=#145a32;fontStyle=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1400" y="606" width="720" height="54" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <!-- Proposal summary note -->
        <mxCell id="alt-note" value="3 grouped cards (Add / Enrich / Refresh). Enrich and Refresh share a &quot;Which source?&quot; step (Google Places vs Local scraper) — it collapses to a single source when only one is available, and the whole card hides when none is. Add is gated on the destination having a My Maps link, importing only unused placemarks. Enrich photos: Local includes them BY DEFAULT; Google Places ASKS to include 1 photo per item (≈ N tag) after the text info." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#fdf2e9;strokeColor=#e67e22;fontColor=#6e2c00;fontSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="600" y="700" width="1050" height="104" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

